Package: pcaboot
Title: Bootstrap Confidence Intervals and Stability Analysis for PCA Loadings 
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ali", "Vali", , "alivali111@yandex.ru", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Principal component analysis (PCA) loadings are typically
    interpreted from a single run, with no measure of uncertainty or
    stability. This package provides bootstrap-based confidence intervals
    for loadings, sign-alignment to resolve the inherent sign ambiguity
    of principal components, and metrics for identifying which variables
    and components are stable across resamples.
